  "how": "Whole-mouse cross-validation: every score comes from a mouse the model never trained on. \"At 20%\" means up to 20% of real spikes may be called Garbage -- the sweep dialog's tolerance; the DS bar stays where 99% of garbage is kept out. Flagged is the share of all candidates left for a person.",
